151	
152	| Event | When |
153	|---|---|
154	| `ChatForegroundChanged(bool isForegrounded)` | App backgrounded/resumed, drawer opened/closed, or Records/Settings pushed/popped (research.md R10) — all treated identically. |
155	| `InsightInactivityTimerFired(DateTime firedAt)` | The 2-minute single-shot `Timer` elapses (research.md R4). |
